            "review_title": "Review at McDonald's Sai Gon Centre",
            "review_text": "Inlovewiththeworld\n3979 contributions\n0\nGood! Junk food craving satisfied. Small branch in the mall.\nJan 2023 • Solo\nSmall branch located amongst other eateries on the lower levels (can't remember which floor) of Saigon Centre mall. Limited seating. Automated ordering system which is easy to use in English and Vietnamese. Accepts cash and card. Staff will help you if you are struggling. I just had the Chicken McNuggets and Sweetcorn which were good. Junk food craving satisfied. If you eat in, you get table service which is cool. Just select this option when ordering and take a table card number thing, input the number and then sit down and place the card on your table. Staff will bring the food to you when ready which was super quick! Reasonably clean. Staff are friendly and helpful. Seats are not the most comfortable so not a place to sit long plus the branch is small. They have a good range of sauces too plus Combo meal options and Rice which we don't get in London.\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2023",
